#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:1
msgid "Clearing the Cache"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:3
msgid ""
"The recipe cache is stored in a directory named `.justcache` alongside the "
"`justfile`. Deleting it will clear the cache."
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:6
msgid ""
"The cache can also be cleared with `just --clean`, which can selectively "
"clear cache entries:"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:10
msgid "# clear all cache entries\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:12
msgid "# clear cache entries for recipe `foo`\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:15
msgid "# clear cache entries for recipe `baz` in submodule `bar`\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:18
msgid "# clear cache entries for recipes in submodule module `bar`\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:21
msgid "# clear cache entries for recipes in submodule module `bar::bob`\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/clearing-the-cache.md:24
msgid "# '::'-separated paths may also be used\n"
msgstr ""
